        <mxCell id="wmbvdQVgA1cLZc2y_ULJ-36" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Topic prediction is required; some topics warrant more attention than others. If, for example,&amp;nbsp;an individual is plotting to kill a rival-gang member (potential murder, serious offence; higher threat score) vs. plotting to kill, e.g., a spider (which is of no interest).&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;strokeColor=#001DBC;fillColor=#0050ef;fontColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#FFFFFF);" vertex="1" parent="1">
